description=A Starfleet shuttlecraft for Project Zomboid, for single player and multiplayer. Beam up from anywhere, lay in a course at the LCARS helm and take her down anywhere with room to land, then board through the hatch. Inside: a galley with running water, a berth, and eight starboard lockers holding sick bay supplies, engineering stores, provisions, survival kit, an armoury and rechargeable phasers. Shields hold the dead back from a landed shuttle. On servers the crew shares one ship; sandbox options limit it to its owner and crew. It needs three tiles by five of clear ground to land.
